      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b8f33ea6d8cbb0cbea80416|full_name}: In this case, my test scene had the object disabled when I entered play mode, and I checked and unchecked the game object long after the scene had been playing. I did not test in-game. I should have specified that this behavior appears in editor.\n\nI did not test OnEnable firing on objects already enabled when going into play mode, because I do not expect consistent behavior in that case: triggers also did not call OnEnable for objects enabled in the scene by default, AFAIK.",
